## The RenderMan Interface's one-sample ColorSamples example, then a Color the renderer
## refuses because it shades only in three components. Not third-party.
Display "colorsamples_refused.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 16 16 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
ColorSamples [0.3 0.3 0.4] [1 1 1]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Color 0.5
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
